GNIRS DC SDSU/ARC timing-board firmware
=======================================

Built and published by gemini-rtsw-ci: every push to main assembles the
firmware from the DSP source here and packages it as the gnirsdc-dsp RPM,
installed to /gem_base/epics/ioc/gnirsdc-dsp/gnirsdc-firmware.

The Motorola DSP56K tools in compil_DSP56K/ are 32-bit Windows console
programs. They run under gemini-wine (github.com/gemini-rtsw/gemini-wine),
which the spec BuildRequires, so the whole build comes from GitHub.

To change firmware:

1) edit the source (FullFrame-unified-*/)

2) ./build-firmware.sh to assemble it locally, in this repo's dev image
   (or `make firmware` inside ./gemini-rtsw-ci/dev_environment.sh --el 9)

3) open a pull request; CI assembles and packages it, and merging to main
   publishes the RPM

NOTE: the production firmware the GNIRS DC loads lives in gnirsdc-data-manager
(src/firmware), with its source.
